{
  "step": 6,
  "preference_text": "One screen: the project view \u2014 what Spec4 shows when a project directory\nis open. One audience, so one screen; no tabs to other screens. Design a\nworking surface, not a product page: no hero, no tagline, no feature\ndescriptions, no illustrations, nothing decorative. Every element on the\npage is a fact, a command, an artifact, or a control.\n\nRegister: dark, quiet, information-dense \u2014 the register of a modern\nterminal emulator or code editor, not a SaaS dashboard. Background\n#0a0a0f, panels #12121c to #1a1a24, borders #2a2a3a, text #f5f5f7, dimmed\n#a0a0b0. Green #39FF14 is the primary colour: primary buttons (Start,\nModify) are green with dark text, the active nav item and active states\nare green, and so is the \"4\" in the \"Spec4\" wordmark. It is the only\naccent \u2014 one green control per region at most, and nothing else on the\npage is green. Secondary buttons and disabled states are neutral outlines.\nBlue #1E88E5 appears only in the wordmark's \"Spec\". No gradients, glows, shadows,\nhover lifts, animation, emoji, or icon fonts. Borders are one pixel.\n\nType: Inter for UI text; JetBrains Mono for every path, file name, model\nname, command, and number. Body 13\u201314px. At most one heading size, and it\nis small. Vertical rhythm on an 8px grid; table rows about 32px tall.\n\nLayout, top to bottom, full width with a maximum around 1100px \u2014 no\ncentred column, no hero spacing:\n\n1. Status bar, which is the header. Left: the wordmark \"Spec4\", small.\n   Then in mono: the working directory, e.g.\n   /Users/rc/projects/bws4 \u00b7 round v3 \u00b7 anthropic \u00b7 claude-sonnet-4-6.\n   Right: nav as plain text links \u2014 Project, Artifacts, Settings, Docs \u2014\n   with the current one marked, and the version 0.6.0. One row, about\n   40px, bottom border.\n\n2. Round tree. A mono heading \".spec4/v3/\". One line per file, in this\n   order: code_review.json, vision.json, feature_specs.json,\n   ai_features.json, design/mock.html, design/manifest.json, stack.json,\n   phases/phase1.md through phases/phase5.md, deployment-plan.md,\n   usage.json. Each line: the file name in mono, coloured by lane, and a\n   status at the right in dimmed text: \"present\", \"needs update\", or\n   \"missing\". Show a realistic mix \u2014 most present, stack.json needs\n   update, deployment-plan.md missing. Under the tree, a three-item\n   legend: \"prompts for the agent\", \"reference for the agent\", \"a record\n   for you\". Pick three restrained hues that read on the dark background\n   and are distinguishable from each other; green is not one of them.\n\n3. Agent rows. A table with seven rows and these columns: Agent \u00b7\n   Produces \u00b7 Last model \u00b7 Tokens this round \u00b7 (action). The rows, in\n   order, with what each produces: CodeScanner code_review.json;\n   Brainstormer vision.json; Agentifier ai_features.json; Designer\n   design/mock.html; StackAdvisor stack.json; Phaser phases/; Deployer\n   deployment-plan.md. The action button reads exactly one of: Start,\n   Modify, Needs Update, Not Ready, Required. Show a realistic mix:\n   CodeScanner Modify, Brainstormer Modify, Agentifier Modify, Designer\n   Modify, StackAdvisor Needs Update, Phaser Not Ready (disabled), Deployer\n   Not Ready (disabled). Model column in mono, e.g. claude-sonnet-4-6,\n   gpt-5-mini; blank for agents that have not run. Tokens as\n   \"41,206 in / 3,118 out\" in mono. Start and Modify are green primary\n   buttons; Not Ready is a disabled neutral outline; Needs Update in a\n   muted warning tone, not a red fill. No step numbers, no descriptions,\n   no icons.\n\n4. Round cost. One compact row or panel: \"Estimated cost, v3: $0.7312 \u00b7\n   Tokens: 118,402 in / 9,640 out \u00b7 2 of 19 calls could not be priced and\n   are excluded\", then one dimmed line: \"Estimates from LiteLLM's price\n   map; your provider's billing is authoritative.\" Figures in mono.\n\nNo footer. No external links other than Docs. No modal, toast, or empty\nstate needed.\n\nThe attached screenshots show the current app so you can see the\nfunctions that exist \u2014 the state buttons, the cost wording, the data\nshape. Reproduce the function, not the styling. The screenshots are the\nthing being replaced.\n\n--- Refinement ---\nFive changes, everything else stays as is.\n1. Buttons: Start is the only filled-green button. Modify becomes a neutral\n   outline button (green text is fine). Needs Update and Not Ready unchanged.\n2. Lane colours: the \"reference for the agent\" lane uses the default text\n   colour, uncoloured. Keep orange for \"prompts for the agent\" and purple for\n   \"a record for you\". Update the legend so the reference swatch is plain.\n   No blue anywhere except the wordmark.\n3. Tree status: remove the word \"present\". Only \"needs update\" and \"missing\"\n   appear, at the right, as now.\n4. Tree width: match the agent table's width.\n5. Cost row: three lines. Line 1: \"Estimated cost, v3: $0.7312 \u00b7 Tokens:\n   118,402 in / 9,640 out\". Line 2: \"2 of 19 calls could not be priced and\n   are excluded: Agentifier (gpt-5-mini), StackAdvisor (gpt-5-mini)\".\n   Line 3, dimmed: the LiteLLM disclaimer as now.\nAlso remove \"Artifacts\" from the nav for this round; it returns next round.",
  "screenshots": [],
  "mock_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Spec4 \u2014 /Users/rc/projects/bws4</title>\n<style>\n  :root {\n    --bg: #0a0a0f;\n    --panel: #12121c;\n    --panel-2: #1a1a24;\n    --border: #2a2a3a;\n    --text: #f5f5f7;\n    --dim: #a0a0b0;\n    --faint: #5a5a6a;\n    --accent: #39FF14;\n    --accent-hover: #31e510;\n    --wordmark-blue: #1E88E5;\n    --lane-prompt: #e8925a;\n    --lane-record: #b39ddb;\n    --warn: #d8b84a;\n    --font-ui: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, sans-serif;\n    --font-mono: \"JetBrains Mono\", ui-monospace, \"SF Mono\", Menlo, Consolas, \"Liberation Mono\", monospace;\n  }\n\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\n\n  html, body {\n    background: var(--bg);\n    color: var(--text);\n    font-family: var(--font-ui);\n    font-size: 13px;\n    line-height: 20px;\n    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n  }\n\n  a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }\n\n  .mono {\n    font-family: var(--font-mono);\n    font-size: 12.5px;\n    font-variant-ligatures: none;\n  }\n\n  :focus-visible {\n    outline: 1px solid var(--accent);\n    outline-offset: 1px;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- Status bar ---------- */\n  .statusbar {\n    height: 40px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    padding: 0 16px;\n    background: var(--panel);\n    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);\n    gap: 16px;\n  }\n\n  .sb-left {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 16px;\n    min-width: 0;\n  }\n\n  .wordmark {\n    font-size: 14px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    letter-spacing: -0.01em;\n    line-height: 20px;\n    flex: none;\n  }\n  .wm-spec { color: var(--wordmark-blue); }\n  .wm-4 { color: var(--accent); }\n\n  .sb-ctx {\n    color: var(--text);\n    white-space: nowrap;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    text-overflow: ellipsis;\n  }\n  .sb-ctx .sep { color: var(--faint); padding: 0 6px; }\n  .sb-ctx .dim { color: var(--dim); }\n\n  .sb-nav {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 16px;\n    flex: none;\n  }\n  .sb-nav a {\n    color: var(--dim);\n    line-height: 38px;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid transparent;\n    margin-bottom: -1px;\n    padding: 0 2px;\n  }\n  .sb-nav a:hover { color: var(--text); }\n  .sb-nav a.active {\n    color: var(--accent);\n    border-bottom-color: var(--accent);\n  }\n  .sb-version {\n    color: var(--dim);\n    margin-left: 8px;\n    padding-left: 16px;\n    border-left: 1px solid var(--border);\n    line-height: 20px;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- View ---------- */\n  .view {\n    max-width: 1100px;\n    padding: 16px 16px 32px;\n  }\n\n  section + section { margin-top: 24px; }\n\n  .section-head {\n    font-family: var(--font-mono);\n    font-size: 13px;\n    font-weight: 500;\n    line-height: 24px;\n    color: var(--text);\n    margin-bottom: 4px;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- Round tree ---------- */\n  .tree-list {\n    list-style: none;\n    width: 100%;\n    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);\n  }\n  .tree-list li {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    height: 24px;\n    padding: 0 8px;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);\n    gap: 16px;\n  }\n  .tree-list li:nth-child(even) { background: var(--panel); }\n  .tree-list .name { white-space: nowrap; }\n  .tree-list .lane-prompt { color: var(--lane-prompt); }\n  .tree-list .lane-ref { color: var(--text); }\n  .tree-list .lane-record { color: var(--lane-record); }\n  .tree-list .status { color: var(--dim); white-space: nowrap; }\n  .tree-list li.is-missing .name { opacity: 0.55; }\n  .tree-list li.is-missing .status { color: var(--faint); }\n\n  .legend {\n    list-style: none;\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 24px;\n    margin-top: 8px;\n    color: var(--dim);\n    font-size: 12px;\n    line-height: 16px;\n  }\n  .legend li { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; }\n  .swatch {\n    display: inline-block;\n    width: 8px;\n    height: 8px;\n    flex: none;\n  }\n  .swatch.lane-prompt { background: var(--lane-prompt); }\n  .swatch.lane-ref { background: var(--text); }\n  .swatch.lane-record { background: var(--lane-record); }\n\n  /* ---------- Agent rows ---------- */\n  .agents-table {\n    width: 100%;\n    border-collapse: collapse;\n    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);\n  }\n  .agents-table th,\n  .agents-table td {\n    height: 32px;\n    padding: 0 8px;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);\n    text-align: left;\n    vertical-align: middle;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n  .agents-table th {\n    font-size: 12px;\n    font-weight: 500;\n    color: var(--dim);\n    background: var(--panel);\n  }\n  .agents-table td.agent { font-weight: 500; width: 140px; }\n  .agents-table td.produces { width: 220px; }\n  .agents-table td.model { width: 220px; }\n  .agents-table td.tokens { width: 220px; color: var(--text); }\n  .agents-table td.model:empty::after,\n  .agents-table td.tokens:empty::after { content: \"\"; }\n  .agents-table th.action,\n  .agents-table td.action { text-align: right; width: 120px; }\n  .agents-table tr.is-disabled td.agent,\n  .agents-table tr.is-disabled td.produces { color: var(--dim); }\n\n  /* ---------- Buttons ---------- */\n  .btn {\n    display: inline-block;\n    height: 24px;\n    min-width: 96px;\n    padding: 0 10px;\n    font-family: var(--font-ui);\n    font-size: 12px;\n    font-weight: 500;\n    line-height: 22px;\n    text-align: center;\n    border: 1px solid var(--border);\n    border-radius: 3px;\n    background: transparent;\n    color: var(--text);\n    cursor: pointer;\n  }\n  .btn:hover { border-color: #3a3a4a; }\n  .btn-primary {\n    background: var(--accent);\n    border-color: var(--accent);\n    color: var(--bg);\n  }\n  .btn-primary:hover {\n    background: var(--accent-hover);\n    border-color: var(--accent-hover);\n  }\n  .btn-modify {\n    color: var(--accent);\n    border-color: #3a3a4a;\n  }\n  .btn-modify:hover { border-color: #4a4a5a; }\n  .btn-warn {\n    color: var(--warn);\n    border-color: rgba(216, 184, 74, 0.45);\n  }\n  .btn-warn:hover { border-color: var(--warn); }\n  .btn-outline { color: var(--text); border-color: #3a3a4a; }\n  .btn:disabled,\n  .btn:disabled:hover {\n    color: var(--faint);\n    border-color: var(--border);\n    background: transparent;\n    cursor: default;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- Round cost ---------- */\n  .cost {\n    background: var(--panel);\n    border: 1px solid var(--border);\n    padding: 8px 12px;\n  }\n  .cost-line {\n    line-height: 24px;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    text-overflow: ellipsis;\n  }\n  .cost-line .sep { color: var(--faint); padding: 0 6px; }\n  .cost-line .label { color: var(--dim); }\n  .cost-note {\n    color: var(--dim);\n    font-size: 12px;\n    line-height: 16px;\n    margin-top: 4px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<header class=\"statusbar\" id=\"statusbar\">\n  <div class=\"sb-left\">\n    <a class=\"wordmark\" href=\"#project\" aria-label=\"Spec4\"><span class=\"wm-spec\">Spec</span><span class=\"wm-4\">4</span></a>\n    <span class=\"sb-ctx mono\" id=\"sb-ctx\"></span>\n  </div>\n  <nav class=\"sb-nav\" aria-label=\"Primary\">\n    <a href=\"#project\" class=\"active\" aria-current=\"page\" data-nav=\"project\">Project</a>\n    <a href=\"#settings\" data-nav=\"settings\">Settings</a>\n    <a href=\"https://spec4.ai/docs\" data-nav=\"docs\" rel=\"noopener\">Docs</a>\n    <span class=\"sb-version mono\" id=\"sb-version\"></span>\n  </nav>\n</header>\n\n<main class=\"view\" id=\"project-view\">\n\n  <section aria-labelledby=\"tree-head\">\n    <h2 class=\"section-head\" id=\"tree-head\"></h2>\n    <ol class=\"tree-list\" id=\"tree-list\"></ol>\n    <ul class=\"legend\" aria-label=\"Lanes\">\n      <li><span class=\"swatch lane-prompt\"></span>prompts for the agent</li>\n      <li><span class=\"swatch lane-ref\"></span>reference for the agent</li>\n      <li><span class=\"swatch lane-record\"></span>a record for you</li>\n    </ul>\n  </section>\n\n  <section aria-label=\"Agents\">\n    <table class=\"agents-table\">\n      <thead>\n        <tr>\n          <th scope=\"col\">Agent</th>\n          <th scope=\"col\">Produces</th>\n          <th scope=\"col\">Last model</th>\n          <th scope=\"col\">Tokens this round</th>\n          <th scope=\"col\" class=\"action\"><span class=\"sr-only\"></span></th>\n        </tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody id=\"agent-rows\"></tbody>\n    </table>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"cost\" aria-label=\"Round cost\">\n    <div class=\"cost-line mono\" id=\"cost-line\"></div>\n    <div class=\"cost-line mono\" id=\"cost-unpriced\"></div>\n    <div class=\"cost-note\" id=\"cost-note\"></div>\n  </section>\n\n</main>\n\n<script>\n  // ------------------------------------------------------------------\n  // Project state \u2014 the shell recomputes the status bar from this on\n  // every render so it can never show a stale directory or round.\n  // ------------------------------------------------------------------\n  var project = {\n    workingDirectory: \"/Users/rc/projects/bws4\",\n    round: 3,\n    defaultProvider: \"anthropic\",\n    defaultModel: \"claude-sonnet-4-6\",\n    version: \"0.6.0\"\n  };\n\n  // Current round's artifacts, in pipeline order. `mtime` null = missing\n  // from disk. `upstream` drives staleness: an artifact needs update when\n  // any upstream artifact is newer. usage.json is exempt.\n  var artifacts = [\n    { path: \"code_review.json\",      lane: \"ref\",    mtime: \"2026-03-02T09:14:00Z\", upstream: [] },\n    { path: \"vision.json\",           lane: \"ref\",    mtime: \"2026-03-04T16:42:00Z\", upstream: [\"code_review.json\"] },\n    { path: \"feature_specs.json\",    lane: \"ref\",    mtime: \"2026-03-04T17:05:00Z\", upstream: [\"vision.json\"] },\n    { path: \"ai_features.json\",      lane: \"ref\",    mtime: \"2026-03-04T17:31:00Z\", upstream: [\"vision.json\", \"feature_specs.json\"] },\n    { path: \"design/mock.html\",      lane: \"ref\",    mtime: \"2026-03-05T10:20:00Z\", upstream: [\"vision.json\", \"feature_specs.json\", \"ai_features.json\"] },\n    { path: \"design/manifest.json\",  lane: \"ref\",    mtime: \"2026-03-05T10:20:00Z\", upstream: [\"vision.json\", \"feature_specs.json\", \"ai_features.json\"] },\n    { path: \"stack.json\",            lane: \"ref\",    mtime: \"2026-03-03T11:08:00Z\", upstream: [\"vision.json\", \"ai_features.json\"] },\n    { path: \"phases/phase1.md\",      lane: \"prompt\", mtime: \"2026-03-05T12:02:00Z\", upstream: [\"stack.json\", \"design/manifest.json\"] },\n    { path: \"phases/phase2.md\",      lane: \"prompt\", mtime: \"2026-03-05T12:02:00Z\", upstream: [\"stack.json\", \"design/manifest.json\"] },\n    { path: \"phases/phase3.md\",      lane: \"prompt\", mtime: \"2026-03-05T12:02:00Z\", upstream: [\"stack.json\", \"design/manifest.json\"] },\n    { path: \"phases/phase4.md\",      lane: \"prompt\", mtime: \"2026-03-05T12:02:00Z\", upstream: [\"stack.json\", \"design/manifest.json\"] },\n    { path: \"phases/phase5.md\",      lane: \"prompt\", mtime: \"2026-03-05T12:02:00Z\", upstream: [\"stack.json\", \"design/manifest.json\"] },\n    { path: \"deployment-plan.md\",    lane: \"prompt\", mtime: null,                   upstream: [\"phases/phase5.md\"] },\n    { path: \"usage.json\",            lane: \"record\", mtime: \"2026-03-05T12:44:00Z\", upstream: [], exempt: true }\n  ];\n\n  // Seven agents in fixed pipeline order. `action` comes from the existing\n  // readiness state model; it is not re-derived here. Model/tokens come\n  // from the round's usage record and are blank when the agent has not run.\n  var agents = [\n    { name: \"CodeScanner\",  produces: \"code_review.json\",   model: \"claude-sonnet-4-6\", tokensIn: 41206, tokensOut: 3118, action: \"Modify\" },\n    { name: \"Brainstormer\", produces: \"vision.json\",        model: \"claude-sonnet-4-6\", tokensIn: 32880, tokensOut: 2914, action: \"Modify\" },\n    { name: \"Agentifier\",   produces: \"ai_features.json\",   model: \"gpt-5-mini\",        tokensIn: 17451, tokensOut: 1206, action: \"Modify\" },\n    { name: \"Designer\",     produces: \"design/mock.html\",   model: \"claude-sonnet-4-6\", tokensIn: 18649, tokensOut: 1530, action: \"Modify\" },\n    { name: \"StackAdvisor\", produces: \"stack.json\",         model: \"gpt-5-mini\",        tokensIn: 8216,  tokensOut: 872,  action: \"Needs Update\" },\n    { name: \"Phaser\",       produces: \"phases/\",            model: null, tokensIn: null, tokensOut: null, action: \"Not Ready\" },\n    { name: \"Deployer\",     produces: \"deployment-plan.md\", model: null, tokensIn: null, tokensOut: null, action: \"Not Ready\" }\n  ];\n\n  // Aggregated usage for the round. Unpriced calls are listed by name and\n  // are excluded from costUsd, never folded in as zero.\n  var usage = {\n    round: 3,\n    calls: 19,\n    tokensIn: 118402,\n    tokensOut: 9640,\n    costUsd: 0.7312,\n    unpriced: [\n      { agent: \"Agentifier\",   model: \"gpt-5-mini\", calls: 1 },\n      { agent: \"StackAdvisor\", model: \"gpt-5-mini\", calls: 1 }\n    ],\n    priceSource: \"LiteLLM's price map\"\n  };\n\n  // ------------------------------------------------------------------\n  var fmt = function (n) { return n.toLocaleString(\"en-US\"); };\n  var esc = function (s) {\n    return String(s).replace(/[&<>\"]/g, function (c) {\n      return { \"&\": \"&amp;\", \"<\": \"&lt;\", \">\": \"&gt;\", '\"': \"&quot;\" }[c];\n    });\n  };\n\n  function renderStatusBar() {\n    var ctx = document.getElementById(\"sb-ctx\");\n    ctx.innerHTML =\n      esc(project.workingDirectory) +\n      '<span class=\"sep\">\u00b7</span>round v' + project.round +\n      '<span class=\"sep\">\u00b7</span>' + esc(project.defaultProvider) +\n      '<span class=\"sep\">\u00b7</span>' + esc(project.defaultModel);\n    document.getElementById(\"sb-version\").textContent = project.version;\n    document.title = \"Spec4 \u2014 \" + project.workingDirectory;\n  }\n\n  function artifactStatus(a, byPath) {\n    if (!a.mtime) return \"missing\";\n    if (a.exempt) return \"present\";\n    var t = Date.parse(a.mtime);\n    for (var i = 0; i < a.upstream.length; i++) {\n      var up = byPath[a.upstream[i]];\n      if (up && up.mtime && Date.parse(up.mtime) > t) return \"needs update\";\n    }\n    return \"present\";\n  }\n\n  function renderTree() {\n    document.getElementById(\"tree-head\").textContent = \".spec4/v\" + project.round + \"/\";\n    var byPath = {};\n    artifacts.forEach(function (a) { byPath[a.path] = a; });\n    var list = document.getElementById(\"tree-list\");\n    list.innerHTML = artifacts.map(function (a) {\n      var status = artifactStatus(a, byPath);\n      var cls = status === \"missing\" ? \" is-missing\" : \"\";\n      // \"present\" is the default and is not labelled; only exceptions show.\n      var label = status === \"present\" ? \"\" : status;\n      return '<li class=\"mono' + cls + '\">' +\n        '<span class=\"name lane-' + a.lane + '\">' + esc(a.path) + '</span>' +\n        '<span class=\"status\">' + label + '</span>' +\n        '</li>';\n    }).join(\"\");\n  }\n\n  var actionClass = {\n    \"Start\":        \"btn-primary\",\n    \"Modify\":       \"btn-modify\",\n    \"Needs Update\": \"btn-warn\",\n    \"Not Ready\":    \"btn-outline\",\n    \"Required\":     \"btn-outline\"\n  };\n\n  function renderAgents() {\n    var body = document.getElementById(\"agent-rows\");\n    body.innerHTML = agents.map(function (ag) {\n      var disabled = ag.action === \"Not Ready\";\n      var hasRun = ag.model !== null;\n      var tokens = hasRun ? fmt(ag.tokensIn) + \" in / \" + fmt(ag.tokensOut) + \" out\" : \"\";\n      return '<tr' + (disabled ? ' class=\"is-disabled\"' : \"\") + \">\" +\n        '<td class=\"agent\">' + esc(ag.name) + \"</td>\" +\n        '<td class=\"produces mono\">' + esc(ag.produces) + \"</td>\" +\n        '<td class=\"model mono\">' + (hasRun ? esc(ag.model) : \"\") + \"</td>\" +\n        '<td class=\"tokens mono\">' + tokens + \"</td>\" +\n        '<td class=\"action\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn ' + actionClass[ag.action] + '\"' +\n          ' data-agent=\"' + esc(ag.name) + '\"' + (disabled ? \" disabled\" : \"\") + \">\" +\n          esc(ag.action) + \"</button></td>\" +\n        \"</tr>\";\n    }).join(\"\");\n  }\n\n  function renderCost() {\n    var line = document.getElementById(\"cost-line\");\n    var unpricedLine = document.getElementById(\"cost-unpriced\");\n    var note = document.getElementById(\"cost-note\");\n    var unpricedCalls = usage.unpriced.reduce(function (n, u) { return n + u.calls; }, 0);\n    var pricedCalls = usage.calls - unpricedCalls;\n\n    // Never show an all-zero figure when the true cost is unknown.\n    var figure;\n    if (usage.calls === 0) {\n      figure = \"no calls recorded\";\n    } else if (pricedCalls === 0) {\n      figure = \"unknown\";\n    } else {\n      figure = \"$\" + usage.costUsd.toFixed(4);\n    }\n\n    var parts = [\n      '<span class=\"label\">Estimated cost, v' + usage.round + \":</span> \" + figure,\n      '<span class=\"label\">Tokens:</span> ' + fmt(usage.tokensIn) + \" in / \" + fmt(usage.tokensOut) + \" out\"\n    ];\n    line.innerHTML = parts.join('<span class=\"sep\">\u00b7</span>');\n\n    if (unpricedCalls > 0) {\n      var names = usage.unpriced.map(function (u) {\n        return esc(u.agent) + \" (\" + esc(u.model) + \")\";\n      }).join(\", \");\n      unpricedLine.textContent = unpricedCalls + \" of \" + usage.calls + \" calls could not be priced and are excluded: \" + names;\n      unpricedLine.hidden = false;\n    } else if (usage.calls > 0) {\n      unpricedLine.textContent = \"all \" + usage.calls + \" calls priced\";\n      unpricedLine.hidden = false;\n    } else {\n      unpricedLine.textContent = \"\";\n      unpricedLine.hidden = true;\n    }\n    note.textContent = \"Estimates from \" + usage.priceSource + \"; your provider's billing is authoritative.\";\n  }\n\n  function render() {\n    renderStatusBar();\n    renderTree();\n    renderAgents();\n    renderCost();\n  }\n\n  // Row actions route to the agent exactly as the existing agent-select\n  // buttons do; the mock records the intent in the URL hash.\n  document.getElementById(\"agent-rows\").addEventListener(\"click\", function (e) {\n    var btn = e.target.closest(\"button[data-agent]\");\n    if (!btn || btn.disabled) return;\n    location.hash = \"agent/\" + btn.getAttribute(\"data-agent\").toLowerCase();\n  });\n\n  // Nav marks the current view; the mock has only the project view.\n  document.querySelector(\".sb-nav\").addEventListener(\"click\", function (e) {\n    var link = e.target.closest(\"a[data-nav]\");\n    if (!link || link.getAttribute(\"data-nav\") === \"docs\") return;\n    e.preventDefault();\n    document.querySelectorAll(\".sb-nav a\").forEach(function (a) {\n      a.classList.remove(\"active\");\n      a.removeAttribute(\"aria-current\");\n    });\n    link.classList.add(\"active\");\n    link.setAttribute(\"aria-current\", \"page\");\n    location.hash = link.getAttribute(\"data-nav\");\n  });\n\n  render();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>",
  "finalized": true
}